name download
category Package
revision 52257
shortdesc Allow LaTeX to download files using an external process
relocated 1
longdesc The package allows the user to download files (using cURL or
longdesc wget), from within a document. To run the external commands,
longdesc LaTeX (or whatever) needs to be run with the --shell-escape
longdesc flag; this creates a tension between your needs and the
longdesc security implications of the flag; users should exercise due
longdesc caution.
runfiles size=2
